<title>UK: Wet Brent cargo trades weaker at Jan +35 cts.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent cargo trades weaker at Jan +35 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo loading Dec 17-19 traded at Jan Brent +35 cents on Wednesday afternoon, lower than Tuesday's traded levels, dealers said.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, two Brent cargoes loading on Dec 18-20 were sold at Jan +42 cents and Jan +44 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
